  "question": {
    "text": "If two points are taken on the minor axis of the ellipse <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> at the same distance from the centre as the foci, then the sum of the squares of the perpendicular distances from these points on any tangent to the ellipse is",
